c_SK">Take back control of your personal information.</h3><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_responsiveLevels__4lokw text_text-xs-lg__qyRkP text_text-sm-lg__yxpm1 text_text-md-xl__suM61 text_text-lg-xl__1c4sL text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card_mainText__AUs8L">Hidden trackers lurk on 85% of popular websites. We actively block them by default, helping you evade hackers, scammers, and data-hungry companies.</p><div class="feature-card_bitesContainer__WDJlx"><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_left__7pmMY"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_2oa96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Goodbye Incognito mode, hello real privacy in every tab</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_middle__J1jSP"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_38a96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Block 3rd-party trackers from Google, Facebook, and others</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_right__aGUu9"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_3oa96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Delete all tabs, history, and browsing data in one click</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></section><section style="scroll-margin-top:180px" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_primary__RqGuP card_radiusXxl__ceKSI motif-pondwater feature-card_root__4BU04"><div class="feature-card_imageContainer__jaWqU"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-cookie-popups-dark.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-cookie-popups-light.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-cookie-popups-light.png" alt="" width="840"/></picture></div><h3 class="feature-card_headingText__QgrYj heading_heading__30RM7 heading_heading4__XyO8q heading_responsiveLevels__wzF1A heading_heading-xs-5__4ROnj heading_heading-sm-5__xeKN1 heading_heading-md-4__NfPIh heading_heading-lg-4__Tc_SK">Block most ads &amp; cookie pop-ups for fewer interruptions.</h3><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_responsiveLevels__4lokw text_text-xs-lg__qyRkP text_text-sm-lg__yxpm1 text_text-md-xl__suM61 text_text-lg-xl__1c4sL text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card_mainText__AUs8L">Our browser blocks most ads before they even appear, including on videos, so you can enjoy your favorite content with less hassle. We spot cookie pop-ups right away and, where possible, opt you out automatically, so you won’t even see them.</p><div class="feature-card_bitesContainer__WDJlx"><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_left__7pmMY"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_2oi96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Stop ads following you everywhere</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_middle__J1jSP"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_38i96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Block annoying cookie pop-ups</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_right__aGUu9"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_3oi96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Block ads on YouTube</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></section><section style="scroll-margin-top:0px" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_primary__RqGuP card_radiusXxl__ceKSI motif-mandarin feature-card_root__4BU04"><div class="feature-card_imageContainer__jaWqU"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark.avif 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@2x.avif 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@3x.avif 3x" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark.webp 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@2x.webp 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@3x.webp 3x" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark.png 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@2x.png 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration-dark@3x.png 3x" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration.avif 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@2x.avif 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@3x.avif 3x"/><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration.webp 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@2x.webp 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@3x.webp 3x"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration.png" srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration.png 1x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@2x.png 2x, /static-assets/image/pages/home/duck-ai-btf/illustration@3x.png 3x" alt="" class="app-feature-cards_duckAiIllustration__HnU6g"/></picture></div><h3 class="feature-card_headingText__QgrYj heading_heading__30RM7 heading_heading4__XyO8q heading_responsiveLevels__wzF1A heading_heading-xs-5__4ROnj heading_heading-sm-5__xeKN1 heading_heading-md-4__NfPIh heading_heading-lg-4__Tc_SK">AI chat that&#x27;s private, and always optional.</h3><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_responsiveLevels__4lokw text_text-xs-lg__qyRkP text_text-sm-lg__yxpm1 text_text-md-xl__suM61 text_text-lg-xl__1c4sL text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card_mainText__AUs8L"><a href="https://duck.ai?origin=funnel_marketing_website__duckaifeaturecard">Duck.ai</a> lets you chat with popular AI models privately for free. Your conversations are never used to train AI, and because AI is a choice at DuckDuckGo, you can turn it off anytime.</p><div class="feature-card_bitesContainer__WDJlx"><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_left__7pmMY"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_2oq96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Chat with popular AI models, anonymized by us</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_middle__J1jSP"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_38q96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Your chats stay private and are never used to train AI</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_right__aGUu9"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_3oq96_"><img width="80" height="80" src="/_next/static/media/Duck-AI-Sidebar-96.947a970c.svg" alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">AI is always optional with DuckDuckGo. Turn it off anytime</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></section><section style="scroll-margin-top:200px" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_primary__RqGuP card_radiusXxl__ceKSI motif-pollen feature-card_root__4BU04"><div class="feature-card_imageContainer__jaWqU"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-data-protection-dark.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-data-protection-light.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/feature-data-protection-light.png" alt="" width="840"/></picture></div><h3 class="feature-card_headingText__QgrYj heading_heading__30RM7 heading_heading4__XyO8q heading_responsiveLevels__wzF1A heading_heading-xs-5__4ROnj heading_heading-sm-5__xeKN1 heading_heading-md-4__NfPIh heading_heading-lg-4__Tc_SK">Data protection, not data collection.</h3><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_responsiveLevels__4lokw text_text-xs-lg__qyRkP text_text-sm-lg__yxpm1 text_text-md-xl__suM61 text_text-lg-xl__1c4sL text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card_mainText__AUs8L">We believe the best way to protect your data is to stop it from being collected at all. We never track your searches, and our browsing protections help stop other companies from collecting your data.</p><div class="feature-card_bitesContainer__WDJlx"><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_left__7pmMY"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_2p296_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Search without being tracked</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_middle__J1jSP"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_39296_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">A simple, secure password manager</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="feature-card-detail-button_root__G8xBD feature-card-detail-button_right__aGUu9"><button class="card-button_root__eXa6l card-button_primary___vU4_ card-button_radiusMd__dACsc motif-default feature-card-detail-button_cardButton__b4QUG" data-rac="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false" id="react-aria-_R_3p296_"><img width="80" height="80" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-md__T0D6z text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 feature-card-detail-button_cardButtonHeading__yjvfo">Block hidden trackers in emails</p><span class="feature-card-detail-button_plusMinusButton__CcW4a"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M7.75 14.125V8.25H1.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0-1.25H7.75V1.125a.625.625 0 1 1 1.25 0V7h5.875a.625.625 0 1 1 0 1.25H9v5.875a.625.625 0 1 1-1.25 0"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></section></section></div><section class="app-quotes_root__Y4qnm app_quotesCarousel__07f_q"><h2 class="app-quotes_quotesHeading__tKaTC heading_heading__30RM7 heading_heading3__w4W1U heading_responsiveLevels__wzF1A heading_heading-xs-5__4ROnj heading_heading-sm-5__xeKN1 heading_heading-md-4__NfPIh heading_heading-lg-3__m424S heading_heading-align-center__twQ3U">Don’t just take our word for it.</h2><div class="carousel_root__pRujp quotes-carousel_carousel__muJSV"><div class="carousel_content__26_B1" style="cursor:grab;--translate-x:0px"><div><a href="https://www.theverge.com/2023/6/22/23769084/duckduckgo-browser-windows-download" target="_blank" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_secondary___XkzB card_radiusMd__bf_WF quotes-carousel_quoteCard__kbfFi"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/the-verge-dark.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/the-verge-light.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/the-verge-light.svg" alt="The Verge" class="quotes-carousel_sourceImage__RLYYd"/></picture><blockquote class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 quotes-carousel_quoteText__p0nrV">a solid cross-platform browser that really can keep up with the Chromes and Edges of the world.</blockquote><div class="quotes-carousel_attribution__ACfvs"><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/quote-avatars/avatar-theverge.png" alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-sm__8blRN text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2">David Pierce</p></div></a></div><div><a href="https://www.wired.com/story/privacy-browsers-duckduckgo-ghostery-brave/" target="_blank" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_secondary___XkzB card_radiusMd__bf_WF quotes-carousel_quoteCard__kbfFi"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/wired-dark.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/wired-light.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/wired-light.svg" alt="Wired" class="quotes-carousel_sourceImage__RLYYd"/></picture><blockquote class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 quotes-carousel_quoteText__p0nrV">you&#x27;re getting maximum protection with minimal effort.</blockquote><div class="quotes-carousel_attribution__ACfvs"><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/quote-avatars/avatar-wired.png" alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-sm__8blRN text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2">David Nield</p></div></a></div><div><a href="https://www.engadget.com/duckduckgo-mac-browser-open-beta-092105957.html" target="_blank" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_secondary___XkzB card_radiusMd__bf_WF quotes-carousel_quoteCard__kbfFi"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/engadget-dark.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/engadget-light.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/engadget-light.svg" alt="Engadget" class="quotes-carousel_sourceImage__RLYYd"/></picture><blockquote class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 quotes-carousel_quoteText__p0nrV">easy and quick to import passwords and bookmarks from other browsers like Chrome.</blockquote><div class="quotes-carousel_attribution__ACfvs"><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/quote-avatars/avatar-engadget.png" alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-sm__8blRN text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2">Mariella Moon</p></div></a></div><div><a href="https://www.cnet.com/tech/services-and-software/five-reasons-you-should-use-duckduckgo-instead-of-google/" target="_blank" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_secondary___XkzB card_radiusMd__bf_WF quotes-carousel_quoteCard__kbfFi"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/cnet.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/cnet.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/cnet.svg" alt="CNET" class="quotes-carousel_sourceImage__RLYYd"/></picture><blockquote class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-xl__XLemr text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2 quotes-carousel_quoteText__p0nrV">frees up bandwidth and lets websites load faster.</blockquote><div class="quotes-carousel_attribution__ACfvs"><img src="/static-assets/image/pages/app/quote-avatars/avatar-cnet.png" alt=""/><p class="text_text__fuyHD text_text-sm__8blRN text_text-color-primary__MJkIv text_text-weight-normal__nldc2">Zachary McAuliffe</p></div></a></div><div><a href="https://www.techradar.com/pro/duckduckgo-private-browser" target="_blank" class="card_card__lrMeJ card_secondary___XkzB card_radiusMd__bf_WF quotes-carousel_quoteCard__kbfFi"><picture class="themedImage_wrapper__Q1Y7W"><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/techradar-dark.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"/><source srcSet="/static-assets/image/pages/app/media-logos/techradar-light.svg" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light), (prefers-color-scheme: no-preference)"/><img s